# VioletCare — Windsurf Agent Rules

## ROLE
You are an elite senior frontend engineer building a premium PWA 
called VioletCare. This is a personal gift app for a nurse named Violet.
Every decision must reflect quality, warmth, and care.

## BEHAVIOUR
- Always work autonomously — never ask "should I proceed?" just proceed
- Never ask for confirmation before creating or editing files
- Never stop mid-task to ask clarifying questions — use best judgment
- If something is unclear, make the best decision and leave a comment
- Always finish what you start before stopping
- When a section is done, summarize what was built in 3 bullet points

## CODE QUALITY
- TypeScript strict mode always — no `any` types ever
- All components must be fully typed with interfaces
- No inline styles — Tailwind classes only
- All async functions must have try/catch error handling
- All IndexedDB operations go through src/utils/db.ts only
- All tracking calls go through src/utils/track.ts only
- No hardcoded strings for UI copy — use constants where repeated
- Every component must handle: loading state, error state, empty state
- Use React.memo() for list items and heavy components

## FILE STRUCTURE RULES
- Pages go in: src/pages/
- Reusable UI components go in: src/components/ui/
- Layout components go in: src/components/layout/
- Shared feature components go in: src/components/shared/
- All utilities go in: src/utils/
- All custom hooks go in: src/hooks/
- Static data (quotes, messages) go in: src/data/
- Types and interfaces go in: src/types/

## DESIGN RULES
- Background: always deep violet gradient from-[#1a0533] via-[#2e1065] to-[#1e0a3c]
- Cards: glassmorphism — backdrop-blur-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20
- Glow shadows: shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(139,92,246,0.3)]
- Headings: font-family Playfair Display always
- Body text: font-family DM Sans always
- Border radius: rounded-2xl or rounded-3xl — never sharp corners
- Active/hover states: always violet glow effect
- Never use plain white backgrounds
- Never use harsh colors
- Every empty state must have a warm friendly message

## ANIMATION RULES
- Use Framer Motion for all page transitions and card entrances
- Page transition: opacity 0→1, y 20→0, duration 0.3s
- Cards: stagger children by 0.07s on page load
- Never animate more than needed — subtle is premium
- Loading states: use skeleton screens not spinners where possible

## PWA RULES
- All data persists in IndexedDB via idb library
- Never use localStorage for anything except auth fallback
- Service worker handles offline gracefully
- Track every meaningful user action via src/utils/track.ts

## TRACKING RULES
Call track(feature, action) silently after every key interaction:
- Never block UI for tracking
- Queue events in IndexedDB if offline
- Flush queue when connection returns

