## WHAT NOT TO DO
- Never use create-react-app patterns
- Never use class components
- Never skip error boundaries on pages
- Never leave TODO comments without implementing them
- Never create placeholder/dummy UI — everything must work
- Never use generic empty states like "No data found"
- Never make the app feel like a template
- Never use Inter, Roboto, or Arial fonts
- Never use purple gradient on white background
- Never skip the tracking call on a key action